) than on the undoped TiO<jats:sub>2<\/jats:sub>(110). The theoretical activity of Cr\u2010, Mo\u2010, Mn\u2010, and Ir\u2010doped TiO<jats:sub>2<\/jats:sub> is found to be close to that of RuO<jats:sub>2<\/jats:sub>(110) for some of the configurations in consideration.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1002\/cctc.201100160","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2011,8,31]],"date-time":"2011-08-31T22:53:08Z","timestamp":1314831188000},"page":"1607-1611","update-policy":"https:\/\/doi.org\/10.1002\/crossmark_policy","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":206,"title":["Tailoring the Activity for Oxygen Evolution Electrocatalysis on Rutile TiO<sub>2<\/sub>(110) by Transition\u2010Metal Substitution"],"prefix":"10.1002","volume":"3","author":[{"given":"M\u00f3nica","family":"Garc\u00eda\u2010Mota","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Aleksandra","family":"Vojvodic","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Horia","family":"Metiu","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Isabela C.","family":"Man","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Hai\u2010Yan","family":"Su","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Jan","family":"Rossmeisl","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]},{"given":"Jens K.","family":"N\u00f8rskov","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"vocabulary":"crossref","role":"author"}]}],"member":"311","published-online":{"date-parts":[[2011,8,25]]},"reference":[{"key":"e_1_2_6_1_2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1016\/j.ijhydene.2008.02.030"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_2_2","doi-asserted-by":"publisher","DOI":"10.1038\/35104599"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_3_2","unstructured":"\u00a0"},{"key":"e_1_2_6_4_2"